<title>INDIA: India group to sell stake in Gujarat Gas.</title>
<headline>India group to sell stake in Gujarat Gas.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Arvind Mafatlal Group (AMG) is seeking to sell its 35 percent holding in natural gas distributor Gujarat Gas Company Ltd, a company official in Ahmedabad told Reuters over the phone on Thursday.</p>
